The official mobile application of the Dobrobut clinic network (Kyiv) provides an opportunity to receive online explanations from a doctor in Ukraine on any issue using a smartphone or tablet with Internet access. The functionality of the application also allows you to independently make an appointment with a doctor online, choosing a convenient time, date, and location, and even pay for the services online.
Digital Dobrobut: application capabilities
Each user of the Dobrobut application in Ukraine can do the following online:
an explanation of the doctors, if you cannot come for a consultation to a clinic in Kyiv for any reason. If the doctor cannot assess your situation online, he will tell you about it and recommend a polyclinic in Kyiv for a detailed study of the issue. After an online explanation, you will be refunded for this service;
making an appointment with a referral from a family doctor, general practitioner, pediatrician or specialist physician: dermatologist, surgeon, gastroenterologist, obstetrician-gynecologist, cardiologist, oncologist, neurologist, or another specialist;
viewing the history of visits to the doctor;
canceling or postponing previously scheduled visits;
viewing medical records;
choosing a doctor in Kyiv and the nearest clinic, determining the shortest route to it;
saving medical history in a smartphone or tablet;
leaving reviews of the doctor's work;
adding a visit to the calendar after the appointment.
How to use the app
The functionality of the Dobrobut application is available only to registered and authorized users. To register you need:
download the application;
enter your last name, first name, patronymic, and year of birth in the online registration form;
enter your mobile phone number;
come up with a username and password, enter them in the appropriate fields of the registration form;
enter the registration code from the SMS sent to your phone.

After registering,  log in to the application using your username and password.

At the bottom of the application there is the main menu, using which you can access the following sections:
Visits;
Online Explanations;
Documents;
Payments;
Contacts.

In the Visits you can:
view the history of visits on the Past tab (the tab menu is located at the top of the page);
remind yourself of upcoming visits (on the Scheduled tab);
make an appointment with a doctor online - all residents of Ukraine, regardless of their place of residence, wishing to be treated in the Kyiv clinics of the Dobrobut medical center can choose a suitable date and time to visit a specialist.

To make an appointment with a doctor online in Ukraine, you need to click the Appointment button in the Visits section and follow the hints. You can find a doctor of the required specialization in the Contacts section on the Doctors tab. The search for a suitable specialist will be facilitated by filters by medical specialty and the network's clinics. For the quarantine period, you can make an appointment only through the contact center of the Dobrobut medical network.

An online doctor's consultation is available in the Online section, where each registered user can get an explanation on a question of interest.

In the Documents section, your medical records are kept with records of each visit to Dobrobut specialists, and you can pay for their services in the Payments section.

The mobile application of the Dobrobut medical center makes medical services more accessible and convenient for residents of Kyiv and Ukraine. Using it, you can:
get an answer to your question in time without leaving your home;
pay for the service online from a smartphone or tablet so that you do not have to waste time paying through the cashier in a clinic in Kyiv;
choose a doctor by rating, professional experience, patient reviews, and cost of services.

The most important thing we have is our health. We are for a healthy lifestyle! 
Smokers don't pass it by!
Smoke - quit is the best way to quit smoking. This app contains lot's of things to help you stop smoking and forget about the nicotine addiction:
-  counts statistics before quitting smoking (number of cigarettes smoked, spent on cigarettes money total weight and length of all cigarettes smoked over a specified period of smoking before making the decision to stop smoking);
-  counts statistics after smoking cessation (number of unlit cigarettes, the savings of time and money, nicotine and tar in your body);
- indication of restoration of health and body after smoking cessation (visually and in real time shows you how your health is recovering after you get rid of smoking);
- interesting and motivating facts for non-smokers, the dangers of smoking, tips to quit smoking;
- smart, simple, and nice interface
- all functions are absolutely free

"DiaCard - ECG Recorder" application is designed to work with ECG recorders of 06000.1, 06000.2, 06000.33, 06000.34, 06000.35, 06000.4, 06000.6, 06000.7 and 12010 models. The application is a component of "Mobile cardiac telemetry system “Telecardian”, that is a part of  "Monitoring system "DiaCard". Recommended OS versions Android 7-12.

     Features:
• modes: "Electrocardiograph", "Stress test", "Event monitor", "Holter";
• ECG viewing in 1, 3, 6 (7) or 12 channels, tuning speed and scale;
• saving ECG records (duration from 10 seconds to 168 hours) to the Archive (internal memory of the tablet, smartphone);
• digital filtering: 0.005, 0.01, 0.05, 0.1, 25, 35, 50/60, 75 Hz, ADS, Finger Electrodes Filter;
• real-time calculation and display of heart rate and RR graphs, electrode breakage control;
• setting alarms (indication and automatic recording): bradycardia, tachycardia, pause, arrhythmia, no signal;
• adding text comments to any recorded fragment;
• operation in the "client–server" mode: remote viewing of ECG and managing the recorder;
• for the "Stress test" mode - full control over the operation of Kettler ergometers of the E and X series;
• for the "Event Monitor" mode - preparation for stand-alone operation (without an Android device), start the research, stop, read records made by the button (on demand), on schedule, on alarm (by signs: tachycardia, bradycardia, arrhythmia, pause, no signal);
• for the "Holter" mode - preparation for stand-alone operation (without an Android device), start the research, stop;
• automatic and manual sending of records to e-mail, to the Telecardian system, to cloud storages or to a hospital information system (on request);
• generating reports, output to a stationary (Wi-Fi) printer, portable (Bluetooth) thermal printer or in a file (pdf);
• automatic processing of records: formation of typical complexes, calculation of amplitude-time indicators, calculation of HRV, Minnesota coding and syndromic conclusion, comprehensive assessment of the state of the cardiovascular system and neurohumoral regulation, basic recommendations
• ECG data export to EDF+, HL7 aEcg, Fazagraf formats;
• viewing records made in the SCP-ECG format (without saving to the Archive);
• integration with other systems and services
(SDK & API - on request);
• monitoring and updating of recorder’s firmware.
- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
* - A full description of the recorders, the Telecardian and DiaCard systems is available on www.solvaig.com and www.telecardian.com

