SafeWander™ is the world’s first wearable sensor that sends an alert to your mobile device when your loved one or patient gets up from a bed or chair, even if you are far away. 

This app requires a SafeWander™ Button Sensor and a Gateway available at https://www.safewander.com

SafeWander™ Button Sensor empowers you to monitor people with falling and/or wandering risk.  It provides unique features that matter:

1. Monitor your patients from any room;

2. Easy to secure the sensor, but hard for your patient to take it off;

3. Monitor multiple patients using one mobile device;

4. Alert rings on your mobile device without frightening your patient or disturbing others;

5. Accurate bed-exiting records enable medication adjustment and better patient care;

6. Tiny, light, discreet, and portable sensor;

7. Replaceable battery lasts up to one year and requires no charging;

8. Easy to set up and simple to operate.

Need help?
https://www.safewander.com/support

